From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan <superwhisz@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Jun 2026 17:25:00 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] SourbyCraft perf-engine P2 excess minecart/boat sweeper

Wires the LAG_MACHINE_REMOVE_EXCESS_MINECARTS + _LIMIT and
LAG_MACHINE_REMOVE_EXCESS_BOATS + _LIMIT knobs that were defined in
Knobs.java but never read. Every 200 ticks (10s), each minecart and
each boat counts how many siblings of its own type share its chunk
via getEntitiesOfClass(class, AABB). If the count exceeds the operator
limit, the entity discards itself.

Cheap because:
  - The check fires once every 10s per entity (low amortized cost).
  - The AABB is chunk-sized; getEntitiesOfClass filters via the
    chunk-system entity index, not a full-world scan.
  - Discard cascades naturally bring the count under the limit
    across consecutive sweep ticks without coordinated bookkeeping.

Blocks the classic minecart/boat hopper-feeder lag-machine pattern
where thousands of stacked vehicles in one chunk burn ticks on
collision + movement updates.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/boat/AbstractBoat.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/boat/AbstractBoat.java
index 84c97b2..32ad191 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/boat/AbstractBoat.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/vehicle/boat/AbstractBoat.java
@@ -236,6 +236,25 @@ public abstract class AbstractBoat extends VehicleEntity implements Leashable {

     @Override
     public void tick() {
+        // SourbyCraft start - perf-engine P2 lag-machine: excess boat sweeper
+        if (!this.level().isClientSide()
+            && this.tickCount > 0
+            && this.tickCount % 200 == 0
+            && dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.perf.knob.Knobs.LAG_MACHINE_REMOVE_EXCESS_BOATS.get()) {
+            int limit = dev.iyanz.sourbycraft.perf.knob.Knobs.LAG_MACHINE_EXCESS_BOATS_LIMIT.get();
+            if (limit > 0) {
+                net.minecraft.world.level.ChunkPos cp = this.chunkPosition();
+                net.minecraft.world.phys.AABB chunkBox = new net.minecraft.world.phys.AABB(
+                    cp.getMinBlockX(), this.level().getMinY(), cp.getMinBlockZ(),
+                    cp.getMaxBlockX() + 1, this.level().getMaxY() + 1, cp.getMaxBlockZ() + 1);
+                int count = this.level().getEntitiesOfClass(AbstractBoat.class, chunkBox, e -> true).size();
+                if (count > limit) {
+                    this.discard();
+                    return;
+                }
+            }
+        }
+        // SourbyCraft end - perf-engine P2 lag-machine
         this.oldStatus = this.status;
         this.status = this.getStatus();
         if (this.status != AbstractBoat.Status.UNDER_WATER && this.status != AbstractBoat.Status.UNDER_FLOWING_WATER) {
